    {
      "text": "magicians of Egypt, Gen. 41:8. Pharaoh also called … sorcerers, Ex. 7:11. not suffer a witch to live, Ex. 22:18 (22:16–20). Regard not them that have familiar spirits, Lev. 19:31. soul that turneth after such as have familiar spirits, Lev. 20:6. not be found among you … an enchanter, Deut. 18:10. soothsayer, did the children of Israel slay, Josh. 13:22. Saul had put away those that had familiar spirits, 1 Sam. 28:3 (2 Kgs. 23:24). used divination and enchantments, and sold themselves, 2 Kgs. 17:17. workers with familiar spirits … Josiah put away, 2 Kgs. 23:24. soothsayers like the Philistines, Isa. 2:6 (2 Ne. 12:6). when they shall say unto you, Seek unto them that have familiar spirits, Isa. 8:19 (19:3; 2 Ne. 18:19). Let now the astrologers … save thee, Isa. 47:13. hearken not … to your sorcerers, Jer. 27:9. there shall be no more … flattering divination, Ezek. 12:24 (13:23). ten times better than all the magicians and astrologers, Dan. 1:20. cannot … the astrologers … shew unto the king, Dan. 2:27. came in the magicians, the astrologers, Dan. 4:7. astrologers … could not shew the interpretation, Dan. 5:15. thou shalt have no more soothsayers, Micah 5:12. be a swift witness against the sorcerers, Mal. 3:5 (3 Ne. 24:5).",
